local notation "CK" c:max=> wheelTimes Y H V G D c b Τ (voter_credit Y H V G D c b C j χ)
local notation "c₀" t:max u:max=> (whenly (dainty Λ) t u:ℝ)
lemma stroll_identity (p q:kc){n m:ℕ}(h:p.val=Θ l'.val 0 (C₀ l'.val (2*(-(n:ℤ))) (Θ a 0 x.val)))(hg:q.val=C₀ l'.val (2*(m:ℤ)) y.val)(hv:(c₀ s (n+m)) ≤ (v:ℝ)) :
   inner ℂ (λx b s x) ((φ).play v (λx b s y))= inner ℂ (Ho l'.val s p) ((vR l'.val) (Real.toNNReal ( (v:ℝ)-(c₀ s (n+m)))) (Ho l'.val s q)):=by
 obtain ⟨t,t₀,z,hz⟩:= ((eventually_ge_atTop s).and (eventually_toned v)).exists; have hp : 0≤ (v:ℝ) := (show 0≤ c₀ s (n+m) by positivity).trans hv
 have h₁: 0≤ z := (MeshClock.bell_le (dainty Λ) t 0 z).1 (by rw [show bell (dainty Λ) t z=_ from congrArg Subtype.val hz]; simpa only [bell,Int.cast_zero,zero_mul] using hp)
 let k' := z.toNat; have hk : (k':ℤ)=z:= Int.toNat_of_nonneg h₁
 let n':= (MeshClock.acts da s t n); let m':= (MeshClock.acts da s t m); let W':= k'-(n'+m'); have origin: (v:ℝ)=(c₀ t k'):=by rw [← hz,← hk]; exact natural_time ..
 have ht': (whenly da s (n+m))= whenly da t (n'+m'):= by unfold n' m'; rw [when_add,when_add,matchR da s t n t₀,matchR da s t m t₀]
 have he:n'+m' ≤ k' := (when_le da t _ _).1 (by rw [ht', origin] at hv; exact hv); have timing:Real.toNNReal ((v:ℝ)-(c₀ s (n+m)))= whenly da t W':=by
       have h':(c₀ t k') = c₀ t (n'+m') + (c₀ t W'):=by rw [show k'=n'+m'+W' from Eq.symm (Nat.add_sub_of_le he), when_add]; rfl
       rw [ht',origin,h',add_sub_cancel_left,Real.toNNReal_coe]
 let X:=hP t₀ x; let Y':=hP t₀ y; let F':= Ht l'.val t₀ p; let Q':=Ht l'.val t₀ q -- Ht binder conflict local notation! rename
 let i:=Θ a 0 X.val
 let u₁:= atSouth Y H a b X; let u₂:= atSouth Y H a b Y'; let e':= axial K a 0 u₁.choose_spec.1; let u:= u₂.choose_spec.1
 have w:F'.val=Θ l'.val 0 (C₀ l'.val (2*(-(n':ℤ))) i):=curvedAhead Y H V G D a b l' t₀ x h
 have w':Q'.val=C₀ l'.val (2*m') Y'.val:= curvedLater Y H V G D a b l' t₀ y hg
 have t': (Θ l'.val 0 (C₀ l'.val (2* (-(n':ℤ))) i))∈ kc:= w ▸ F'.property
 have eG:C₀ l'.val (2*m') Y'.val∈kc:= w' ▸ Q'.property
 have HW:= reach_eq Y H V G D l'.val b t Τ (x:=i) e' u t' eG k' he
 rw [timing, show v= notch da t (k':ℤ) from (by rw [hk,hz]),regime_value, badges_join Y H V G D a b Τ t₀ (x:=x), badges_join Y H V G D a b Τ t₀ (x:=y),atLane] -- moves v RHS in Ht
 change inner ℂ _ _= inner ℂ _ ((vR l'.val) _ _); rw [badges_join Y H V G D l'.val b Τ t₀ (x:=p), badges_join Y H V G D l'.val b Τ t₀ (x:=q),ages_pose, measures_here]; unfold poleForm; let R':= flow_port K l'.val (2*(k':ℤ)) u
 have hF:=InTest.mul (e'.mono (Finset.subset_union_left (s₂:= _))) (R'.mono Finset.subset_union_right); rw [Bool.xor_self] at hF
 change (Τ).pulse t (Reflect.chord b • (mirror K a 0 X.val*chime K l'.val (2*k') Y'.val)) = inner ℂ (Ho l'.val t F') (Ho l'.val t (walkC Y H l'.val b W' Q'))
 rw [(Τ).scale t (aux_test hF)]
 dsimp only at HW; rw [show F'=(⟨_,t'⟩: kc) from Subtype.ext w, show Q'=(⟨_,eG⟩: kc) from Subtype.ext w']
 exact HW.symm -- expect rfl alignment cast on subtypes extension not proofirrelev terms.Supply via w,w'
end both

